{
  "uid": "platform-application",
  "title": "Platform — Application",
  "tags": ["platform", "application"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Data source",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": { "text": "Prometheus", "value": "prometheus" },
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "Namespace",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "query": "label_values(kube_deployment_created, namespace)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      },
      {
        "name": "app",
        "label": "Application",
        "description": "Any Deployment in the namespace. The Application type names its Deployment after the instance, so an Application always appears here under its own name.",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "query": "label_values(kube_deployment_created{namespace=\"$namespace\"}, deployment)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "One dashboard for **every** app the platform runs — pick an instance above rather than looking for a dashboard named after it. Nothing here is authored per app, which is the point: an app onboarded tomorrow appears in this list with no dashboard work at all.\n\n**Delivery** (below) is derived from kube-state-metrics and the kubelet. It works for every Application with no cooperation from the app whatsoever, and its three panels are the ones the platform also alerts on.\n\n**Application signals** needs the app to serve Prometheus metrics and to set `metrics.enabled: true` on its `Application`. Those panels are **empty for an app that hasn't opted in, and that is correct, not broken** — the platform cannot invent a request rate for an app that doesn't count requests.\n\nThe RED panels expect the standard Prometheus client names — `http_requests_total{status}` and `http_request_duration_seconds_bucket` — which are what `prometheus-fastapi-instrumentator` and the equivalents in other languages emit by default. An app using different names still gets everything in Delivery; it just needs its own panels for the rest."
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Delivery — no app cooperation required",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Available replicas",
      "description": "0 for 10 minutes is what fires ApplicationNotAvailable.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{namespace=\"$namespace\",deployment=\"$app\"}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Restarts (24h)",
      "description": "More than 3 in any 15 minutes is what fires ApplicationRestartLooping.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",container=\"$app\"}[24h]))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 4 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Memory used, share of limit",
      "description": "Above 90% for 15 minutes is what fires ApplicationMemoryNearLimit. The limit comes from the Application's spec.size, not from anything the app set.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max(container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"$namespace\",container=\"$app\"} / on (pod, container) group_left() kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"$namespace\",container=\"$app\",resource=\"memory\"})",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.75 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.9 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "CPU throttled",
      "description": "Share of scheduling periods in which the container was held back at its CPU limit. Sustained throttling shows up as latency, never as an error — which is why it gets a panel here and no alert.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 6 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max(rate(container_cpu_cfs_throttled_periods_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",container=\"$app\"}[5m]) / clamp_min(rate(container_cpu_cfs_periods_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",container=\"$app\"}[5m]), 1))",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.25 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memory — working set against the limit",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"$namespace\",container=\"$app\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max(kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"$namespace\",container=\"$app\",resource=\"memory\"})",
          "legendFormat": "limit"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": [] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "limit" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash", "dash": [8, 6] } },
              { "id": "custom.fillOpacity", "value": 0 },
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU — cores used against the limit",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 10 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",container=\"$app\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "max(kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"$namespace\",container=\"$app\",resource=\"cpu\"})",
          "legendFormat": "limit"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": [] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 3,
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "limit" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash", "dash": [8, 6] } },
              { "id": "custom.fillOpacity", "value": 0 },
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Container readiness",
      "description": "A boolean over time, so it is drawn as one — gaps and flapping are visible here in a way a line chart of 0/1 hides.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 18 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "kube_pod_container_status_ready{namespace=\"$namespace\",container=\"$app\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": false },
        "mergeValues": true,
        "showValue": "never",
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 0, "fillOpacity": 80 },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": { "text": "Not ready", "color": "red", "index": 0 },
                "1": { "text": "Ready", "color": "green", "index": 1 }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Restarts per 15 minutes",
      "description": "The exact window ApplicationRestartLooping evaluates; its threshold of 3 is drawn as the dashed line.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 18 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",container=\"$app\"}[15m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": [] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "transparent", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 3 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },

    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Application signals — requires metrics.enabled on the Application",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate by status",
      "description": "Empty unless the app serves http_requests_total. That is the expected state for an app that has not opted in — not a broken panel.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_requests_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$app-.*\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": [] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Error ratio (5xx)",
      "description": "Server errors as a share of all requests. A ratio rather than a count, so it stays readable whether the app serves one request an hour or a thousand a second.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 25 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$app-.*\",status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_requests_total{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$app-.*\"}[5m])), 0.0001)",
          "legendFormat": "5xx share"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": false },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "dashed" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "transparent", "value": null },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.05 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency",
      "description": "Quantiles over http_request_duration_seconds. p99 alongside p50 deliberately: a median that looks fine while the tail does not is the common shape, and one line would hide it.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 25 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$app-.*\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$app-.*\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{namespace=\"$namespace\",pod=~\"$app-.*\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": [] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}
